    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ec4ebfd8391b4df9a982288c88182ba1",
      "statement": "The main agent's tool list is dynamic: admin threads add ADMIN_TOOLS (automation operations create/update/delete/trigger/list, workspace management list/publish/snapshotctl/configure/delete, organization-skill operations save/delete, send_announcement), desktop local_run collapses to just http_request/fetch_url/web_search, Slack channel-ask mode removes thread-bound Slack operations and mutations for /oswe questions, Slack DM mode removes slack_add_reaction, Slack tools are removed when Slack context unavailable with scheduled runs keeping slack_list_channels/slack_post_message, personal user-settings tools are removed when no credential login is verified, human review tools are removed when Slack bot context unavailable, expedited review tools are removed when disabled or Slack bot context unavailable, incident tools are conditionally added with automatic sweeps excluding mutations, and the subagent excludes save_user_settings and tools requiring parent-agent context.",
