    {
      "id": "claim_fb224bcc43f94e3db0a5f8045ca5dca0",
      "statement": "Sandbox tool access uses capability-based JWT authentication: when a sandbox is created, the system issues a ToolAccess capability bearing thread_id and sandbox_id, signed with DASHBOARD_JWT_SECRET; the sandbox receives a $TOOLS_PORT bridge URL to call tool endpoints, with tool calls authenticated by verifying the JWT and confirming the sandbox is bound to that thread, keeping secrets out of the sandbox.",
